---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<p>Most of what’s here lives on the <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.¹</p>
			<p>I've also got a set of <a href="/artefacts">artefacts</a> used for open source PRs, but these aren't great to browse.</p>
			<p>You can also <a href="/about/">read more about me</a> or <a href="/rss.xml">subscribe via RSS</a>.</p>
			<p>¹ but not much yet, I'm just building the thing.</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
